<title>FRANCE: Rouen March 1-5 flour exports 21,390 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen March 1-5 flour exports 21,390 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen reached 21,390 tonnes between March 1 and March 5, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 74,000 tonnes for the whole of March 1996.</p>
<p>March 1-5 exports included 1,000 tonnes for West Africa and 20,390 for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
